"Lead story: Skiff dragged the earth-shaper out from under the lake; the villain is in intensive care."
"Hannah Elber was an A-rank Adjuster, once battlefield support to the Chicago hero Arjun Thomas."
"Captions say her memorial is set for February 13 on Anesidora Island if she has not returned."
"A crawl runs hero sightings and a reminder that all Avowed must register with the government."
"Weather: snow tapering by noon, a high of nineteen, colder tonight, more snow Monday."
"Ads run for Anesidora tourism, a lawyer for superhuman-incident claims, and consulate classes."
"Sports: the Bulls lost at home last night; the Blackhawks play tonight."
